 The other findings are Scarlet's ([Found on this game](../0100A3D008C5C000/README.md#found-on-this-game)).
 
+- [A host segment reclaimed through another command buffer's block](../../../docs/reference/nvn-objects.md#a-host-segment-reclaimed-through-another-command-buffers-block): 4.0.0 (a derived profile) on the iPhone aborted in `nvn_queue_submit` just after the opening, once the render workers' command memory blocks lay between one another's (resolved in the host; not yet rerun on the device).
